ent-TungstenGasCanister = tungsten gas canister
    .desc = A reinforced gas canister with six times the capacity of a standard storage canister.

ent-TungstenGasCanisterBroken = broken tungsten gas canister
    .desc = A broken reinforced gas canister. Its remains can be salvaged for materials.

ent-TungstenTlecCanister = tungsten canister "BOOM"
    .desc = A reinforced tungsten canister filled with Tlec. The "BOOM" label is a reminder to think before opening the valve.
